     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: ValueSet immunization-status-reason-vs</b></p><a name=\"immunization-status-reason-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcimmunization-status-reason-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include estes códigos, tal como definidos em <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> versão Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Código</b></td><td><b>Ecrã</b></td><td><b>Portuguese (pt)</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/62479008\">62479008</a></td><td>Acquired immune deficiency syndrome (disorder)</td><td>Síndrome de imunodeficiência adquirida</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/427099000\">427099000</a></td><td>Active tuberculosis (disorder)</td><td>Tuberculose ativa</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/699618001\">699618001</a></td><td>Administration of prophylactic antituberculosis agent (procedure)</td><td>Administração de agente antituberculoso profilático</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/293104008\">293104008</a></td><td>Adverse reaction to component of vaccine product (disorder)</td><td>Reação adversa a componente de produto de vacinação</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/131145007\">131145007</a></td><td>Altered immunity (finding)</td><td>Imunidade alterada</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/1217476001\">1217476001</a></td><td>Anaphylaxis caused by component of vaccine product (disorder)</td><td>Anafilaxia causada por componente de produto de vacinação</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/126764002\">126764002</a></td><td>Congenital anomaly of intestinal tract (disorder)</td><td>Anomalia congénita do trato intestinal</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/36138009\">36138009</a></td><td>Congenital